      <slug></slug>
      <title>A new build system</title>
      <subtitle>with added unit testing</subtitle>
      <track>LibreOffice devroom</track>
      <type></type>
      <language></language>
      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;come and see the new LibreOffice build system, faster, sweeter, simpler.&lt;/p&gt;      </abstract>
      <description>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The LibreOffice build has been based on an internal, patched version of dmake for a decade. It is time to move on - and the new world is based on GNU make, which gives us lots of important features; in particular, fast incremental building, and all manner of interesting new possibilities.&lt;/p&gt;      </description>
      <persons>
          <person id="1681">Björn Michaelsen</person>
      </persons>
      <links></links>
      <video></video>
      <end></end>
  </event>